  "title": "Spicy Asian Cellophane Noodle Salad",
  "description": "Asian style salad with cellophane noodles, hard boiled eggs, fried tofu, and sauteed zucchini and onion, tossed with a tasty, spicy Thai chile sauce.",
  "authors": [
